WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.320
keep the left hand clear and wait for the right hand to present the mug.

2
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.960
grasp the exposed surface of the mug while the right hand still supports it.

3
00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:37.980
maintain the left mug grasp and wait for the right hand to release and withdraw.

4
00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:48.180
carry the received mug toward the rack while retaining the grasp.

5
00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:49.500
place the mug onto the rack hook.

6
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.700
release the mug after the rack supports it.

7
00:00:50.700 --> 00:01:08.047
keep the left arm in its current position.

